---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <title>DAH World — Deeper African History</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Source+Serif+4:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { background: #0a0a06; color: #f0ebe0; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; }

    .top-bar {
      background: #B8860B;
      padding: 5px 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #0a0a06;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    nav {
      background: #0a0a06;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #C4873A44;
      padding: 0 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      height: 60px;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #f0ebe0;
      margin-right: 28px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .nav-logo span { color: #C4873A; }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
      flex: 1;
      gap: 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .nav-links li a {
      display: block;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #7a6a50;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-links li a:hover { color: #C4873A; border-bottom-color: #C4873A; }
    .nav-links li a.active { color: #C4873A; border-bottom-color: #C4873A; }

    .nav-cta {
      background: #C4873A !important;
      color: #0a0a06 !important;
      font-weight: 700 !important;
      border-radius: 2px;
      border-bottom: none !important;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 500px;
      background: #0a0a06;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 60px 40px 48px;
      position: relative;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #C4873A22;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #C4873A;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 58px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #f0ebe0;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero-title span { color: #C4873A; }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #8a7a60;
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 520px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .ticker {
      background: #C4873A;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0a0a06;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .coming-soon {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 24px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #3a3020;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .coming-soon span {
      color: #C4873A;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-bar">
    <span>COVERING ALL 55 AFRICAN NATIONS — WORLDWIDE</span>
    <span>DR. JOHN TEACHES · DEEPER AFRICAN HISTORY</span>
  </div>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">DAH <span>·</span> World</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="/" class="active">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="/nations">All 55 Nations</a></li>
      <li><a href="/history">Deep History</a></li>
      <li><a href="/news">Current Events</a></li>
      <li><a href="/dna">DNA & Origins</a></li>
      <li><a href="/art">Art & Museums</a></li>
      <li><a href="/stem">STEM</a></li>
      <li><a href="/futbol">Fútbol ⚽</a></li>
      <li><a href="/books">Book Store</a></li>
      <li><a href="/challenges">Challenges</a></li>
      <li><a href="/community">Community</a></li>
      <li><a href="/enroll" class="nav-cta">Enroll — $97/mo</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Dr. John Teaches · Est. 2026</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        The World's Authority<br>on <span>African History</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Fact-based, scholar-curated coverage of all 55 African nations —
        history, culture, DNA origins, current events, art, and science.
        Built for a worldwide audience.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ticker">
    HISTORY FACT: The University of Timbuktu operated 600 years before Oxford was founded &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    DNA: Modern human migration traces back 200,000+ years to Eastern Africa &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    55 COUNTRIES · North · West · East · Central · Southern Africa &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    NEW: Heritage Scholar VIP Retreat · St. Croix, US Virgin Islands · Limited Seats
  </div>

  <div class="coming-soon">
    <span>DAH World is being built.</span>
    Full launch coming soon — 55 nations, deep history, and the course that changes everything.
  </div>

</body>
</html>